From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: dt-bindings: timer: faraday,fttmr010: add the GalaChip GC1601 timer

The GC1601 timer is an FTTMR010 that counts down and needs its interrupt
status cleared, so it gets its own compatible.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/timer/faraday,fttmr010.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/timer/faraday,fttmr010.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
           - aspeed,ast2600-timer
           - cortina,gemini-timer
           - faraday,fttmr010
+          - galachip,gc1601-timer
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
